  - Charlie R.C and xilabao share an address (177 lines).
  - Albert Nigmatzianov and bogem share an address (164 lines).
  - Tomas Aschan may be counted twice (56 lines, 0.4% merged).
- **Not shown:** the numbers say nothing about code quality, review work, design work or code that was deliberately deleted.

